## Suspend / Resume Fix

### Symptoms

- Resume takes a long time
- WiFi disappears after resume
- Audio stops working
- Applications report I/O errors
- System eventually freezes or shows a black screen

Example:

```text
bash: /usr/bin/top: Input/output error

Root Cause

The Apple NVMe SSD (PCI device 0000:01:00.0) enters PCIe D3cold during suspend and does not reliably recover during resume.

Workaround

Disable D3cold:
echo 0 | sudo tee /sys/bus/pci/devices/0000:01:00.0/d3cold_allowed

Result

✅ Deep Sleep works

✅ Resume works

✅ WiFi works

✅ Audio works

✅ No I/O errors

✅ Stable system after resume
